  "body": "Stacked on #3353 (merge #3353 first)\n\n## What changed\n\n- Add `OpType::Pocket` to `do_not_touch_applies` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs`.\n- Update `do_not_touch_unsupported` to list `2D Pocket, 2D Offset and 3D Pocket`.\n- Update the `set_operation_do_not_touch` text in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` and `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`.\n- Wire `OpParams::Pocket` with `avoid_spec` in `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` to `pocket_avoid_entered_with_relief`, `rest_pocket_avoid_with_relief`, and `rest_pocket_previous_avoid_with_relief`.\n- Extract per-level planning (`plan_avoid_level`), relief checks (`check_reliefs_avoid`), crossing-free checks (`enforce_level_crossing_free`), and rest dispatch (`emit_rest_avoid`) into `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_avoid_level.rs`.\n- Unify plain and rest avoid paths in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_avoid.rs`, `rest2d.rs`, and `rest_prior.rs` under `pocket_avoid_over`.\n- Check overhead keep-out zones up to `p.clearance_z.max(z)` so entry rapids and final clearance lifts clear overhead obstacles.\n- Guard `Descent::Helix` (`m.solid_restart`) and `entry_restart` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/descent.rs` and `descent_dive.rs` with `helix_clears_prior`, `find_clear_helix_raw`, `moves_clear`, and `helix_cross_fallback`.\n- Record between-pass `KeepDown` chords in `LinkState.level` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/ladder_links.rs`.\n- Derive `Clone` for `LinkTally`, `LinkState`, and `WalkState`.\n- Add pinning tests in `crates/motion/tests/avoid_pocket.rs`, `crates/app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`.\n- Record the design choice in `docs/decisions/3345-do-not-touch-2d-pocket.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\n- `do_not_touch_applies` refused `OpType::Pocket`, and `OpParams::Pocket` in `generate.rs` dropped `avoid_spec`.\n- `pocket_avoid` supported plain 2D Offset only. It lacked `PreHole` entries and rest plans, and it checked overhead obstacles only up to `retract_z`.\n- When keep-out zones trimmed inner passes across depths under `OffsetRings` + `KeepDown` + `Helix`, restarted helices overlapped earlier helices in XY at shared entry depths.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Before the fix, `pocket2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge` failed in `set_operation_do_not_touch`.\n- Before the fix, `pocket2d_boundaries_shows_pick_protected_and_takes_viewport_click` panicked on the missing `\"Pick protected\"` button.\n- After the final edit, `camcraft-motion --test avoid_pocket` passed all 6 tests (`empty_avoid_matches_plain_paths_exactly`, `pocket_avoid_all_strategies_entries_holder_and_edge`, `pocket_avoid_keeps_final_clearance_lift_clear_of_overhead_obstacle`, `pocket_avoid_offset_rings_keep_down_never_crosses`, `pocket_avoid_predrilled_and_rest_stay_clear`, `pocket3d_avoid_shell_rest_and_adaptive_stay_clear`).\n- After the final edit, `camcraft-app --test do_not_touch` passed all 5 tests (`pocket2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge`, `pocket2d_without_do_not_touch_gives_identical_toolpath`, `offset2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge`, `pocket3d_do_not_touch_keeps_clear_raises_links_and_blocks_impossible_cut`, `do_not_touch_post_gate_blocks_violations`).\n- After the final edit, `camcraft-app --test mcp_doc_drift` passed all 6 tests.\n- After the final edit, `camcraft-ui --lib` passed all 4 `egui_app::tests::do_not_touch` tests (`pocket2d_boundaries_shows_pick_protected_and_takes_viewport_click`, `unsupported_op_shows_do_not_touch_note_without_pick_button`, `geometry_boundaries_shows_do_not_touch_controls_rows_and_viewport_marks`, `avoid_marks_cache_reuses_still_frames_and_follows_input_changes`).\n- After the final edit, `env -u RUSTC_WRAPPER cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with zero warnings.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 400 runnable steps with zero failures (`motion` 83 steps, `ui` 11 steps, `app` `lib` and 305 suites run in `--only` batches). `app build (--no-run)` was omitted because each batched `app` step built and ran its target directly, and `sccache` was disabled because the local cache server was unreachable.\n- Mutation checks (reverted and restored):\n  - Reverting `avoid.rs` made `pocket2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge` fail in `set_operation_do_not_touch`. Restoring it passed.\n  - Reverting `generate.rs` made `pocket2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge` fail with gouges, `rapid_in_stock`, and flute and shank hits. Restoring it passed.\n  - Mutating `top_above` in `pocket_avoid.rs` to `retract_z` made `pocket_avoid_keeps_final_clearance_lift_clear_of_overhead_obstacle` fail (`AvoidHit { at: 95, item: 1, part: Holder, short_mm: 13.0 }`). Restoring it passed.\n  - Bypassing `helix_clears_prior` and `moves_clear` in `descent_dive.rs` made `pocket2d_do_not_touch_keeps_full_tool_clear_of_protected_face_and_edge` fail (`feed moves 55 and 437 cross in XY at shared depth`). Restoring it passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `gate heavy` and `gate batch` did not run locally.\n- Interactive GPU viewport rendering did not run; UI tests ran under headless `egui_kittest`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- Stacked on #3353 (`base-3353`), which modifies `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_avoid.rs`, `rest2d.rs`, `mod.rs`, and `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`.\n- Touches the same operation-support list and files as #3413 (`Face`), #3462 (`Trace`), and #3495 (`Finish3D`) in `avoid.rs`, `mcp/tools.rs`, `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`, `generate.rs`, `tests/do_not_touch.rs`, and `egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`. Whichever merges second merges the operation list and refreshes.\n- Touches the same files in different functions as #3402, #3439, and #3494 (`PassStart` in `pocket_avoid.rs`, `rest2d.rs`, `mod.rs`, `generate.rs`), #3441 (`Circular` in `descent.rs`, `descent_dive.rs`, `levels.rs`, `mod.rs`), and #3426, #3458, #3478, #3496, #3497, #3502, and #3503 (`generate.rs` or `machining2d/mod.rs`). Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Support Do not touch protected faces and edges on 2D Pocket operations\nFixes #3345\n",
